"timestamp":1774453602689},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":" 收到。\n\n今晚执行规则：\n- **连夜推进**\n- **持续推进**\n- **不停止**\n- **不因为到了深夜就自动停**\n\n明早我会给你汇报，重点会按这三块讲清：\n- **main 做了什么**\n- **xixi 做了什么**\n- **aoao 做了什么**\n\n我现在继续往前推，不再停下来问废话。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0d8886978b870ccc0169c40371ff5081918c58065a7a7abf7a\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774453611670}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:3c64fbc0-beb0-4137-9204-749c9ebd2c88","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: 每日晚间 workspace 收口","displayName":"Cron: 每日晚间 workspace 收口","updatedAt":1774443900304,"sessionId":"d4fb27ec-5485-489e-8e36-cc1d268fcd7a","model":"deepseek-v3.2","systemSent":true,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/d4fb27ec-5485-489e-8e36-cc1d268fcd7a.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现在让我检查项目目录的内容，看看是否有需要整理的文件：\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_aj50pd5cgzru5oua5u5crpfx","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace && ls -la project/ 2>/dev/null || echo \"project 目录不存在\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774443967258},{"role":"assistant","content":[],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","stopReason":"aborted","timestamp":1774444180591,"errorMessage":"Request was aborted."}]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-main-feishu-default-direct-ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","deliveryContext":{"channel":"feishu","to":"user:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","accountId":"default"},"updatedAt":1774413703442,"sessionId":"81ef30ee-a922-4821-96b7-84553d757d64","model":"gpt-5.4","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":61296,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"feishu","lastTo":"user:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","lastAccountId":"default","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/81ef30ee-a922-4821-96b7-84553d757d64.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering a response**\n\nI see that the user didn't ask directly but sent content from a session, so it’s likely I need to respond as if it’s a message. I’ll make sure to keep my reply concise and focused on the main point without using any tools. Just being clear and direct should work well in this case. I want to ensure I’m addressing their needs effectively!"},{"type":"text","text":" 这版已经够用了，**P1 可以按这个发，P2 就按最小 docs patch 跟。**\n\n**我拍板**\n- **P1 标题**：用 **Title 1**\n  - `Routing diagnostics gap: it is hard to tell whether inbound traffic matched a binding or fell back to the default agent`\n- **P1 定性**：继续坚持\n  - 不是 confirmed bug\n  - 是 **diagnostics / observability gap**\n- **P2 范围**：只补解释，不碰实现，不扩写大文档\n\n**我认可的点**\n1. `Background -> What is unclear -> Why this matters -> Suggested improvement -> Minimal reproduction`\n   - 这个结构很稳，maintainer 读起来不容易起逆反\n2. `The issue here is not that routing is confirmed to be wrong.`\n   - 这句必须保留\n3. `Which routing rule actually determined the target agent?`\n   - 这是整篇 issue 的锚点，别丢\n4. P2 那 3-4 句补丁\n   - 足够小，merge 概率高\n\n**我建议再加一刀微调**\n在 P1 `Suggested improvement` 前或后，加一句，进一步降火：\n\n> This report is not asserting wrong routing yet; it is asking for a clearer operator-facing way to confirm which routing rule won.\n\n这句你前面已经验证过，很值。\n\n**P2 docs PR 我建议的提交风格**\n标题别太重，直接走这种：\n- `docs: clarify how canonical session keys relate to routing outcomes`\n- 或\n- `docs: clarify group routing interpretation in multi-agent setups`\n\n别写 `fix incorrect docs`，容易把 review 气氛搞硬。\n\n**执行顺序我建议锁死**\n1. 先补最后 3 个证据字段\n2. 发 P1 issue\n3. 立刻做 P2 最小 docs PR\n4. 等 maintainer 反馈后，再决定要不要补诊断面增强提案\n\n**一句话**\n现在不是“继续讨论方向”的阶段了，已经是**把 P1 发出去、把 P2 做出来**的阶段。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_090b64d726cd28200169c36773681c8191af954179bf2d3fc6\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774413679581},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"状态：成功\n任务：从 maintainer 视角复核 P1 diagnostics gap issue，给出风险表述、safer rewrite、objection list，并明确先发 issue 还是 docs PR\n结果：\n一、P1 diagnostics gap issue 的 5 个风险表述（容易被打回）\n1. 风险表述：`Feishu group messages were routed to the wrong agent.`\n- safer rewrite：`In local setup, it was difficult to explain why a Feishu group message was routed to a specific agent.`\n\n2. 风险表述：`There was no binding, but routing still happened.`\n- safer rewrite：`No obvious explicit binding was visible from the operator's point of view, but routing still resolved to a specific agent.`\n\n3. 风险表述：`This proves a routing bug in OpenClaw.`\n- safer rewrite：`This suggests a diagnostics/observability gap: the winning routing rule was not easy to inspect.`\n\n4. 风险表述：`OpenClaw silently and unexpectedly falls back.`\n- safer rewrite：`The observed outcome may have been caused by fallback or implicit binding resolution, but the operator-facing reason was not clear.`\n\n5. 风险表述：`The docs are wrong / inconsistent with implementation.`\n- safer rewrite：`The current docs may not make this routing outcome easy to reason about in practice, especially in multi-agent group setups.`\n\n二、maintainer objection list（至少 5 条）+ 对应简短应答\n1. objection：This is expected behavior. Unmatched inbound traffic falls back to the default agent.\n- 应答：Agreed. The report is not asserting wrong routing yet; it is asking for a clearer way to confirm whether fallback was the winning rule.\n\n2. objection：You may still have channel/account/default bindings or historical bindings.\n- 应答：Yes, and that is exactly the issue: the operator could not easily tell which rule actually matched.\n\n3. objection：This sounds Feishu-specific, not a core routing issue.\n- 应答：Observed in a local Feishu group setup, but the underlying diagnostics problem appears broader for multi-agent routing.\n\n4. objection：Routing precedence is already documented.\n- 应答：The precedence is documented, but the current operator experience does not clearly expose which rule won for a specific inbound message.\n\n5. objection：This belongs in docs, not an issue.\n- 应答：A docs improvement would help, but an issue is still useful to request a diagnostics/observability surface if maintainers agree that current inspection is insufficient.\n\n6. objection：You need stronger reproduction before claiming a product problem.\n- 应答：Agreed, which is why the framing avoids “wrong routing” and focuses on explainability of the observed outcome.\n\n7. objection：The session key already shows which agent handled the message.\n- 应答：Yes, but the canonical session key reflects the selected agent after routing; it does not explain which routing rule won.\n\n三、结论：P1 先发 issue，还是先发 docs PR\n- 明确判断：**先发 P1 issue，再发 docs PR。**\n\n四、判断依据\n1. P1 的核心价值在于把问题定义为 diagnostics/observability gap，而不是写死在某一页文档上。\n2. 如果先发 docs PR，maintainer 很可能只把它当“文案补充”，不会正面回应“是否需要暴露 winning routing rule”。\n3. 先发 issue 更利于争取一个明确态度：\n- maintainers 是否认同当前可解释性不足；\n- 是否愿意增加日志/诊断输出；\n- 还是仅希望通过 docs 解决。\n4. docs PR 适合作为 P1 issue 的后续动作：当 maintainer 接受“这里确实难解释”后，再补 group routing 与 canonical session key 的澄清文档，更顺。\n\n原因：从 maintainer 视角，最容易打回的是“你把 expected behavior 误报成 bug”。所以要先把 issue 写成一个低冲突、可接受的 diagnostics gap 讨论入口。只要 issue 站稳，docs PR 就会更容易被接。\n建议：\n1. P1 issue 正文里主动放这句：\n`This report is not asserting wrong routing yet; it is asking for a clearer operator-facing way to confirm which routing rule won.`\n2. 标题坚持用：\n`Diagnostics gap: expose whether inbound routing matched a binding or fell back to the default agent`\n3. P2 docs PR 暂时作为跟进项，不抢在 issue 前面发。"}],"timestamp":1774413690423,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","sourceChannel":"webchat","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":""},{"type":"text","text":" 认可，这个判断我拍板了：\n\n## 结论\n**先发 P1 issue，再发 P2 docs PR。**\n\n不是反过来。\n\n## 原因\n你这次复核抓得很准，关键点有两个：\n\n1. **P1 讨论的是“诊断面够不够”**\n   - 不是单页文档 wording 问题\n   - 而是 maintainer 要不要承认：\n     - 当前 routing outcome **不够好解释**\n     - operator side **不容易确认 winning rule**\n\n2. **如果先发 docs PR，问题容易被降级成“补一句文案”**\n   - 这样 maintainer 很可能绕开核心问题\n   - 最终只给一个轻描淡写的 docs merge\n   - 但不会正面回应：**要不要暴露 winning routing rule**\n\n所以顺序必须是：\n- **P1 issue 先立题**\n- **P2 docs PR 后跟进**\n\n## 标题我建议再定一次\n你最后给的这个版本更利索，我建议直接优先用：\n\n**`Diagnostics gap: expose whether inbound routing matched a binding or fell back to the default agent`**\n\n比之前那个更短，更像 maintainer 会接受的问题标题。\n\n如果想保守一点，也可以用：\n**`Routing diagnostics gap: it is hard to tell whether inbound traffic matched a binding or fell back to the default agent`**\n\n我的偏好：\n- **更像 issue 标题**：`Diagnostics gap: expose whether...`\n- **更像问题描述**：`Routing diagnostics gap: it is hard to tell whether...`\n\n## 正文必须保留的一句\n这句必须进正文，别删：\n\n> This report is not asserting wrong routing yet; it is asking for a clearer operator-facing way to confirm which routing rule won.\n\n这句就是降冲突护城河。\n\n## 我现在的执行决定\n下一步我会按这个路线继续推进：\n1. 锁 P1 最终标题和正文\n2. 补最后证据字段\n3. 准备可直接贴 GitHub 的最终版\n4. P2 docs PR 暂时做成 follow-up，不抢发\n\n## 一句话\n**先拿到 maintainer 对“这里确实难解释”的承认，再补文档。**  \n这才是最稳打法。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_090b64d726cd28200169c3677d81e48191acdf96c8bd09bdf1\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774413690426}]},{"key":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","kind":"other","channel":"webchat","displayName":"webchat:g-agent-aoao-feishu-aoao-direct-ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","deliveryContext":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1774413679499,"sessionId":"7aa0f524-f67d-48d9-8f40-bd2db6719e48","model":"gpt-5.4","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":73699,"abortedLastRun":false,"la