{"type":"message","id":"4d4e1d36","parentId":"6dc07b8d","timestamp":"2026-03-26T00:24:36.926Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"根据昨晚的进展和当前状态，我来生成晨报：\n\n---\n\n**2026-03-26 晨报 (周四, 8:22)**\n\n**总览摘要**\n1. 昨晚连夜推进 OpenClaw 贡献项目，P1 diagnostics gap issue 已准备就绪\n2. aoao 完成 maintainer 视角复核，xixi 产出可直接贴 GitHub 的英文内容\n3. 今日重点：发布 P1 issue，跟进 P2 docs PR\n\n**昨夜推进进展**\n[已完成] **aoao 复核**：从 maintainer 视角完成 P1 issue 风险审查，给出 5 个高风险表述 + safer rewrite + objection list + 简短应答\n[已完成] **aoao 决策**：明确 **先发 P1 issue，再发 P2 docs PR** 的执行顺序\n[已完成] **xixi 产出**：直接产出可贴 GitHub 的 P1 diagnostics gap issue v2 英文完整版 + P2 docs PR 最小改动大纲\n[已完成] **main 拍板**：确认 P1 标题用 `Routing diagnostics gap: it is hard to tell whether inbound traffic matched a binding or fell back to the default agent`\n[关键] **P1 issue 核心立场**：不是 confirmed bug，而是 diagnostics/observability gap，降低冲突风险\n\n**OpenClaw 贡献项目当前状态**\n- **P1 diagnostics gap issue**：v2 英文版已备好，包含 Background/What is unclear/Why this matters/Suggested improvement/Minimal reproduction\n- **P2 docs PR**：最小改动大纲已定，只补解释层，不改实现，降低 review 风险\n- **执行顺序**：先发 P1 issue，再发 P2 docs PR\n- **关键句保留**：`This report is not asserting wrong routing yet; it is asking for a clearer operator-facing way to confirm which routing rule won.`\n\n**多 Agent 分工总结 (昨夜-今晨)**\n- **main**：总体协调、拍板决策、确认标题与执行顺序\n- **xixi**：主调研 + 直接产出可贴 GitHub 的英文内容\n- **aoao**：从 maintainer 视角复核风险、提供 objection list、明确顺序建议\n\n**今日日程 / 天气 / 待办**\n**🌤️ 天气 (上海)**\nshanghai: ⛅ +13°C，多云舒适\n\n**📅 日历**\n暂无今日紧急日程\n\n**✅ 今日待办**\n- [ ] 补全 P1 issue 最后证据字段\n- [ ] 发布 P1 diagnostics gap issue 到 GitHub\n- [ ] 准备并提交 P2 docs PR（最小补丁）\n- [ ] 观察 10:30 贡献推进检查 cron 首次运行\n\n**一句话总结**\n昨夜已完成 P1 issue 全部准备，今日按既定顺序推进发布；节奏已从\"讨论方向\"转为\"执行落地\"。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":45542,"output":632,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46174,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774484647250}}
